a matrix with $n$ columns, then \n\n$$\n\\text{rank}(A)+\\text{nullity}(A)=n.\n$$\n\nFor the given matrix, we have $n=9,$ and since $B$ is formed by $7$ vectors, $\\text{rank}(A)=7.$ Therefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{rank}(A)+\\text{nullity}(A) & =n \\\\ 7+\\text{nullity}(A) & =9 \\\\ \\text{nullity}(A) & =9-7 \\\\ \\text{dim(Null}(A)) & =2.\\end{aligned}\n$$", ":question/answer-fields": [{":answer-field/id": "df0f6f2c-4a63-5d83-9bf3-536743ed5407", ":answer-field/key": "selection", ":answer-field/type": ":answer-field.type/radio", ":answer-field/choices": [{":answer/id": "4a6d18d3-5504-5726-a085-6e2f78b1aaf9", ":answer/type": ":answer.type/math", ":answer/value": "0"}, {":answer/id": "511cbf23-2338-52a2-b6f4-d67dd05c446c", ":answer/type": ":answer.type/math", ":answer/value": "1"}, {":answer/id": "06cbd63b-9cee-55c3-ada4-a90519dd9b8b", ":answer/type": ":answer.type/math", ":answer/value": "2"}, {":answer/id": "560c363e-d6dd-5937-a307-1f0133a6fd38", ":answer/type": ":answer.type/math", ":answer/value": "3"}, {":answer/id": "b2489f61-3c50-5065-9e62-8763a9000f0b", ":answer/type": ":answer.type/math", ":answer/value": "4"}], ":answer-field/correct": [":answer/id", "06cbd63b-9cee-55c3-ada4-a90519dd9b8b"]}]}, "generation": {"version": "rank-nullity-description-v1", "seed": 718113667, "template": "column-basis", "profile": "small", "parameters": {"m": 7, "n": 9, "k": 7}, "correct_value": "2", "mathematical_fingerprint": "a106a5145ba576d5ec2fffc00221b78c15350b319ea8235959e5f395c4cab597", "content_fingerprint": "6842d791d4975dd2e92dbc4a7f0a1c3b07153d67dd089962405a45fab77807d4", "source_question_ids": ["q-35433", "q-141230", "q-35305"], "source_basis": 2516, "source_lineage": "01a12a15-3e0a-75a1-9dac-f8b8c5d5c3f1", "dependencies": {"python": "3.13.5", "sympy": "1.14.0"}, "plots": "none", "domain": "real vector spaces; full column rank parameter coefficient matrix", "math_format": "course-academy-tex-v1"}}, "checks": [{"field_index": 0, "submitted_answer_id": "4a6d18d3-